    {
      "subId": "7500133",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750013301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750013301": {
            "id": "750013301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "奇怪，为什么那些金色花纹同样都已经飘过去了…在这里的柱子底下却没有出现「镌光铭印」？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013302"
            ]
          },
          "750013302": {
            "id": "750013302",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "说明这里的「镌光铭印」不仅被挤压出来，还变得不完整了…这下可麻烦了，还得找到分散在他处的「镌光铭印」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013303"
            ]
          },
          "750013303": {
            "id": "750013303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以那个分散在其他地方的「镌光铭印」在哪里？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013304"
            ]
          },
          "750013304": {
            "id": "750013304",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "…我也不知道。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013305"
            ]
          },
          "750013305": {
            "id": "750013305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013306"
            ]
          },
          "750013306": {
            "id": "750013306",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "虽然分散，但是毕竟仍然是受到力量的约束，所以应该就在附近才对，或许需要找找…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013307"
            ]
          },
          "750013307": {
            "id": "750013307",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀，呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013308"
            ]
          },
          "750013308": {
            "id": "750013308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#怎么了，你想去那边？现在{NICKNAME}和我们有更重要的事要做，待会儿再陪你玩好不好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013309"
            ]
          },
          "750013309": {
            "id": "750013309",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯…呀！呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013310"
            ]
          },
          "750013310": {
            "id": "750013310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "意思是，铭印在那边吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013311"
            ]
          },
          "750013311": {
            "id": "750013311",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013312"
            ]
          },
          "750013312": {
            "id": "750013312",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "哎呀，听说就算到了现在，也有龙能够感应「镌光铭印」的力量，以前一直以为是传言，没想到也许是真的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013313"
            ]
          },
          "750013313": {
            "id": "750013313",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "#果然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不是一只普通的小嵴锋龙啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013314"
            ]
          },
          "750013314": {
            "id": "750013314",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "原来你还有这种本事呀，哼，不过比起我这个向导，还是有不小的差距的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013315"
            ]
          },
          "750013315": {
            "id": "750013315",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013317",
              "750013319"
            ]
          },
          "750013317": {
            "id": "750013317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哪有，我的心胸可比看上去宽广多了！这、这只是我夸奖的一种方式啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013320"
            ]
          },
          "750013320": {
            "id": "750013320",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯…嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013321"
            ]
          },
          "750013321": {
            "id": "750013321",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唉，这个小家伙根本没听懂嘛，真是的，如果能再聪明一点就好了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013322"
            ]
          },
          "750013322": {
            "id": "750013322",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "总有它能够听懂的时刻的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013323"
            ]
          },
          "750013323": {
            "id": "750013323",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "是啊，而且部族里负责看顾龙的人们都说，想要和龙达成情感上的互通，是要花上很长很长时间的事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013324"
            ]
          },
          "750013324": {
            "id": "750013324",
            "speakerId": 21719,
            "speakerName": "蒂图",
            "text": "而能跟龙打成一片的秘诀是：耐心与持续不断地交流。不管是人想去理解龙，还是龙想要理解人，都需要…需要很长的时间哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013325"
            ]
          },
          "750013325": {
            "id": "750013325",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#是呢…就像刚才我也没有意识到{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}想要向我们说什么一样呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013326"
            ]
          },
          "750013326": {
            "id": "750013326",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#对不起哦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013327"
            ]
          },
          "750013327": {
            "id": "750013327",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯，呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013328"
            ]
          },
          "750013328": {
            "id": "750013328",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你这倒是应得很快！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750013329"
            ]
          },
          "750013329": {
            "id": "750013329",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好啦，那就朝着你刚才想去的地方，去找找看有没有那种金色花纹吧。"
          },
          "750013319": {
            "id": "750013319",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是夸奖没错，不过一定不能因此骄傲自大…"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}